     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<br><br>I just put this information up on Andrew&#39;s blog: <a href=\"http://andrewgelman.com/2017/01/11/stancon-2017-schedule/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://andrewgelman.com/2017/01/11/stancon-2017-schedule/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459005121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw241LU5QrDiiIXEYO5GJjOk\">http://andrewgelman.com/2017/01/11/stancon-2017-schedule/</a><br><br>A few additional pieces of info (not in the post):<ul><li>social media: #stancon2017<br></li><li>we sell out at 180; we&#39;re at 125<br></li><li>we have a restaurant / bar picked out for after the conference</li></ul>Thanks and see you soon.<div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Daniel<br><p></p><div></div><p></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><a href=\"http://mc-stan.org/events/stancon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mc-stan.org/events/stancon&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459005121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UKJnzb8nfvc_nBzy9E_NC\"><img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/NdKaoJGP1YIzMuK0PJur3_zNQOUkFbssVn7hyK4hUXt2u8w_dWkSgSE88E1rj4_u2s5uCTkvCMH00jvvaJXZqg1NEZzlCnNK-33mlpScaE2ukeaByR_nKlO9QZaBMxnXlx8=s0-d-e1-ft#http://andrewgelman.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/stancon2017_logo-300x149.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"248\" style=\"min-height:auto;max-width:100%\"></a></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\">The first <a href=\"http://mc-stan.org/events/stancon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://mc-stan.org/events/stancon&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459005121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0UKJnzb8nfvc_nBzy9E_NC\">Stan Conference</a> is next Saturday, January 21, 2017!</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\">If you haven&#39;t registered, here&#39;s the link: <a href=\"https://stancon2017.eventbrite.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://stancon2017.eventbrite.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459005121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1v69F6ybwykSsxTlAH6bcs\">https://stancon2017.eventbrite.com</a><br>I wouldn&#39;t wait until the last minute -- we might sell out before you&#39;re able to grab a ticket. We&#39;re up to 125 registrants now.<br>(If we have any tickets left, they are $400 at the door.)</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><strong>Schedule</strong></p><table style=\"border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187);color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><tbody><tr><th style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Time</th><th style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">What</th></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">7:30 AM - 8:45 AM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Registration and breakfast</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">8:45 AM - 9:00 AM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Opening statements</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">9:00 AM - 10:00 AM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\"><b>Dev talk:</b><br>Andrew Gelman:<br>&quot;10 Things I Hate About Stan&quot;</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">10:00 AM - 10:30 AM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Coffee</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">10:30 AM - 12:00 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\"><p><b>Contributed talks:</b></p><ol><li>Jonathan Auerbach, Rob Trangucci:<br>&quot;Twelve Cities: Does lowering speed limits save pedestrian lives?&quot;</li><li>Milad Kharratzadeh:<br>&quot;Hierarchical Bayesian Modeling of the English Premier League&quot;</li><li>Victor Lei, Nathan Sanders, Abigail Dawson:<br>&quot;Advertising Attribution Modeling in the Movie Industry&quot;</li><li>Woo-Young Ahn, Nate Haines, Lei Zhang:<br>&quot;hBayesDM: Hierarchical Bayesian modeling of decision-making tasks&quot;</li><li>Charles Margossian, Bill Gillespie:<br>&quot;Differential Equation Based Models in Stan&quot;</li></ol></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">12:00 PM - 1:15 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Lunch</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">1:15 PM - 2:15 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\"><b>Dev talk:</b><br>Michael Betancourt:<br>&quot;Everything You Should Have Learned About Markov Chain Monte Carlo”</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">2:15 PM - 2:30 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Stretch break</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">2:30 PM - 3:45 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\"><p><b>Contributed talks:</b></p><ol><li>Teddy Groves:<br>&quot;How to Test IRT Models Using Simulated Data&quot;</li><li>Bruno Nicenboim, Shravan Vasishth:<br>&quot;Models of Retrieval in Sentence Comprehension&quot;</li><li>Rob Trangucci:<br>&quot;Hierarchical Gaussian Processes in Stan&quot;</li><li>Nathan Sanders, Victor Lei:<br>&quot;Annualized Rate of Mass Shootings&quot;</li></ol></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">3:45 PM - 4:45 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Mingling and coffee</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">4:45 PM - 5:45 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Q&amp;A Panel</td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">5:45 PM - 6:00 PM</td><td style=\"font-family:inherit;font-size:inherit;border:1px dashed rgb(187,187,187)\">Closing remarks</td></tr></tbody></table><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\">If you can&#39;t tell, it&#39;s going to be a packed day. If we have tickets at the door, they&#39;re $400.</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><strong>Sponsors</strong></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\">We couldn&#39;t have done this without support from our sponsors. Seriously. <br>Bonus: all our sponsors are using Stan!</p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><a href=\"http://datascience.columbia.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://datascience.columbia.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459005121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3hv1H2XKYPXepEUbIeESkM\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/lGQWQ7N396VCB3E8iyGwoEzj_fsyQ3oupLCSXIi1HbJcqA1G8VlHrDs9XrLFd2vK36KHLLDftCrGUZFHahsy175wT2Ma9iiZv-QbF9MKBBc74ixnQfjBxBIavK082sNaxqjLK7VeuYNth5Y=s0-d-e1-ft#http://andrewgelman.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/columbia_data_science_logo-300x90.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"90\" style=\"min-height:auto;max-width:100%\"></a></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><a href=\"http://metrumrng.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://metrumrng.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459005121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-tgRyJYKqEI3zFmWeYbSt\"><img src=\"https://ci3.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Vmn_xm5Qcy7QFA0zOUy6-IwO3RQvicjCDLTHTbYBZX7myDp2-_Grnk8Ibl97YmEOOf8I2CxXagS1skgSNhZIP1ZFbDoelz_kkK5fE3Fc2IsI3fH4ZpIx7SVmWdA=s0-d-e1-ft#http://andrewgelman.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/metrum_logo-300x57.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"57\" style=\"min-height:auto;max-width:100%\"></a></p><p style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:georgia,&quot;times new roman&quot;,&quot;bitstream charter&quot;,times,serif;font-size:16px\"><a href=\"http://www.rcanalytics.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.rcanalytics.com/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792459005121000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1dZv3e5VpLlIx3Hn9kkp-d\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/Px-f0An5g5TFKnCl_qKaokIDswPRmVRC56JcfHq6mMfIDj9UAypJSm8T1rXL8NT8J5T7l68zXoivab2JXgSmBazsTmzQx8foZ6Uohg9puNacsg2Rp